  "description": "The Dawes Venture range is built for versatility, offering a comfortable and dependable ride for city streets, countryside tracks, and everything in between. Whether you're commuting, exploring, or simply enjoying a leisurely ride, these hybrid bikes are designed to adapt to your needs with lightweight aluminium frames and rider-focused geometry. With simplicity and comfort at their core, the Venture models feature ergonomic designs, reliable components, and optional low-step frames for easy access. Perfect for riders seeking practicality and ease of use, the Venture range combines value, comfort, and versatility to suit any adventure, The Dawes Venture 2.0 EQ offers a practical solution for riders looking to explore towns, cities, and countryside tracks with ease. Featuring a lightweight aluminium frame and relaxed geometry, the Venture delivers a comfortable and dependable ride whether you’re commuting, running errands, or venturing off the beaten path. Equipped with a 3x7 Shimano Tourney gearing, the Venture 2.0 provides a wide gear range to tackle climbs and cruise comfortably on flats. Alloy V-brakes ensure reliable stopping power and are simple to maintain. Fully equipped with mudguards and a rear pannier rack that add practicality for everyday use. Swept-back handlebars, ergonomic grips, and a padded saddle make each ride smooth and enjoyable.",
